#: ../../source/getting_started/troubleshooting.md:10
msgid "TELINK_TOOLCHAIN_PATH Not Found"
msgstr "未找到 TELINK_TOOLCHAIN_PATH"

#: ../../source/getting_started/troubleshooting.md:12
msgid "**Error**: `Error: TELINK_TOOLCHAIN_PATH environment variable not set`"
msgstr "**错误**：`错误：未设置 TELINK_TOOLCHAIN_PATH 环境变量`"

#: ../../source/getting_started/troubleshooting.md:14
#: ../../source/getting_started/troubleshooting.md:31
