msgid "**Solution**:"
msgstr "**解决方法**："

#: ../../source/getting_started/troubleshooting.md:27
msgid "west init -l Reports \"already initialized\""
msgstr "west init -l 报告\"已初始化\""

#: ../../source/getting_started/troubleshooting.md:29
msgid ""
"**Cause**: The `ZEPHYR_BASE` environment variable points to a Zephyr "
"workspace containing a `.west` directory."
msgstr ""
"**原因**：`ZEPHYR_BASE` 环境变量指向包含 `.west` 目录的 Zephyr 工作区。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/troubleshooting.md:41
msgid "CMake Configuration Failed"
msgstr "CMake 配置失败"

#: ../../source/getting_started/troubleshooting.md:45
msgid "Verify the CMake version (requires >= 3.20.0)."
msgstr "验证 CMake 版本（需要 >= 3.20.0）。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/troubleshooting.md:46
msgid "Clear old build cache and retry:"
msgstr "清除旧构建缓存并重试："

#: ../../source/getting_started/troubleshooting.md:50
msgid "Verify that all required dependencies are installed correctly."
msgstr "验证所有必需的依赖项是否正确安装。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/troubleshooting.md:52
msgid "Python Dependency Installation Failed"
msgstr "Python 依赖项安装失败"

#: ../../source/getting_started/troubleshooting.md:56
msgid "Check your network connection."
msgstr "检查您的网络连接。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/troubleshooting.md:57
msgid ""
"Verify that the virtual environment is activated (the terminal prompt "
"should have a `(.venv)` prefix)."
msgstr ""
"验证虚拟环境是否已激活（终端提示符应有 `(.venv)` 前缀）。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/troubleshooting.md:58
msgid "If required, configure a proxy:"
msgstr "如有需要，配置代理："

#: ../../source/getting_started/troubleshooting.md:63
msgid "Build Issues"
msgstr "构建问题"

#: ../../source/getting_started/troubleshooting.md:65
msgid "Compilation Error"
msgstr "编译错误"

#: ../../source/getting_started/troubleshooting.md:69
msgid "Check the source code for syntax errors."
msgstr "检查源代码中是否存在语法错误。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/troubleshooting.md:70
msgid "Verify that the chip and board are configured correctly."
msgstr "验证芯片和开发板的配置是否正确。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/troubleshooting.md:71
